<title>ST VINCENT: SOCCER-HONDURAS BEAT ST VINCENT 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HONDURAS BEAT ST VINCENT 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honduras beat St Vincent and</p>
<p>Grenadines 4-1 (halftime 3-0) in a World Cup CONCACAF semifinal,</p>
<p>group three qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>St Vincent - Robert Shewitt (58th minute)</p>
<p>Honduras - Nicolas Suazo (7th and 62nd), Christian Santamara</p>
<p>(23rd and 43rd)</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> Jamaica	   2  2  0  0  5  1  6</p>
<p> Honduras	  3  2  0  1  6  5  6</p>
<p> Mexico	    2  1  0  1  4  2  3</p>
<p> St. Vincent     3  0  0  3  2  9  0</p>
<p>Next match: Oct 16 - Mexico v Jamaica</p>
</text>
